{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:18.205.050","page_type":"section"},"citation":"18.205.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","content_hash":"a25e7dfcca99e29f55d1d65ecb2c88cd22bb4be6a63094e66a2b520c6b4dd29c","heading":"Use restrictions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","text":"Notwithstanding any other provisions of this chapter, no use may be made of land or water within any zone established by this chapter in such a manner as to:\n(a) Create electrical interference with navigational signals or radio communication between airport and aircraft;\n(b) Make it difficult for pilots to distinguish between airport lights and others;\n(c) Result in a glare in the eyes of pilots using the airport;\n(d) Impair visibility in the vicinity of the airport; or\n(e) Otherwise in any way create a hazard or endanger the landing, takeoff or maneuvering of aircraft intending to use the airport. (Code 1981 § 4-59. Code 1995 § 22-30.)\nState Law References: Use restrictions authorized, K.S.A. 3-703 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"8b11b7ea-f074-5f81-b8c5-f11335cdb7b1"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.205.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","content_hash":"b867729823736b1bf490b6b19d8ed34a1dad9ac46681f81f817041f1e84d651d","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","text":"Notwithstanding any other provisions of this chapter, no use may be made of land or water within any zone established by this chapter in such a manner as to:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"98bd5058-d62a-5c7c-8bfa-3c17afb2beed"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.205.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","content_hash":"fccc0153ca56784a7f98996ceecc138786173315236773d59d2cd27862351dfe","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","text":"(a) Create electrical interference with navigational signals or radio communication between airport and aircraft;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"cf71345b-d107-5aee-8b60-a3767ca183ea"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.205.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","content_hash":"de732961a758104dd4069ef3ee0e4c7a228c692c94b1a21b3c60ec261198a69e","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","text":"(b) Make it difficult for pilots to distinguish between airport lights and others;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4cd2a62f-fb1f-5a4b-a769-02bae60b2c00"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.205.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","content_hash":"31442b300fa8c4f7fa307933a1f7fa999b4073ec0a508712bf5e6e7a19cfa6d5","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","text":"(c) Result in a glare in the eyes of pilots using the airport;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"06ad930e-f358-5afb-aed5-57e57ae18473"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.205.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","content_hash":"f5885f0da804ad3bac8bb91d37c57820b64182789c074e777b4ca9298049b940","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","text":"(d) Impair visibility in the vicinity of the airport; or","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"7c54c2b4-c40e-5742-8220-a8673fbed673"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.205.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","content_hash":"770d3da544a41adb3ad678ed78d91415b62662ea5f618320377f672a6458c7f7","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","text":"(e) Otherwise in any way create a hazard or endanger the landing, takeoff or maneuvering of aircraft intending to use the airport. (Code 1981 § 4-59. Code 1995 § 22-30.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"6aaeb874-de75-500f-962a-6008d015bc69"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.205.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.205.050","content_hash":"ba830b58336a7ce8469a3f0fd649e4f3807df0427d163dac3577487d1e0b4713","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.205.050:section","schema":"ex